nodes.body:
Thanks to @saitarrun for coordinating and closing #43692 as a duplicate: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/43692#issuecomment-6117497630.

This PR retains the real CLI regression tests on current head `d13da00cca8c5cc0deed1892c290899ca3f38999`: 3 test methods and 8 CLI executions covering whitespace-prefixed arrays, JSONL, flat and parent-child SMG spans, and mixed SMG/engine flow and output checks.

@merrymercy @Kangyan-Zhou, could you help approve the applicable workflows and route code review? The overlap is resolved, but 14 workflows still await maintainer approval, and an approving review is still required. The two completed checks have passed; the pending workflows have not run yet. Thank you!

@merrymercy @fzyzcjy @sufeng-buaa @slin1237 @CatherineSue @Kangyan-Zhou @Fridge003,

Could you help move this OTEL-to-Perfetto fix through review? Head `d13da00c` is unchanged: the real CLI regression covers 3 test methods / 8 executions, and the full pre-commit results are recorded above. The duplicate PR was closed, but 14 workflows still await maintainer approval and no approving review has been recorded.

Could the observability/SMG reviewers inspect the converter behavior, and a maintainer with the required permissions authorize the applicable workflows? Please help assign a review owner and share an expected review time, or identify any concrete changes still needed. Once the required checks and reviews pass, could a merge oncall help complete the merge? Thank you.

